{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"veryblue-scorpionic-marabou","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\nThe live Jira DC lane's rich-text fidelity tests (tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_dc_rich_text_live.py) time out in _wait_until_search_reflects, which blocks until a JQL SEARCH reflects a just-pushed description. Its budget is a FIXED timeout=90.0s with a fixed 2s poll.\n\nJira DC's Lucene index is eventually consistent and, on the ephemeral CI instance under load, reindex latency routinely runs 83-90s: in the last GREEN run (32696579734, Aug 24) these same tests PASSED but with per-test setup times of 90.73s and 83.30s — right at the 90s ceiling. In run 33035272265 the index was slightly slower and both tests failed with 'the index never reflected the pushed body ... within 90s (45 attempts)'. The test's own message says: 'This is NOT a bridge defect — the write succeeded, the SEARCH cannot see it yet.'\n\n## Root cause\nFixed 90s search-index-lag budget with essentially zero margin over the observed ~90s reindex latency. Same search-index-lag class that ticket 1d21 hardened for the Cloud probe (fixed 6x5s -> capped-exponential to 195s); the DC rich-text helper (_wait_until_search_reflects) was never hardened.\n\n## Fix\nRaise the DC search-visibility budget to carry real margin over the observed ~90s reindex latency (consistent with the Cloud hardening's worst-case ~195s), keeping the SEARCH-visibility semantics (not a direct GET) and the fail-loud 'not a bridge defect' assertion.\n\n## Impact\nBlocks the RP-03 epic's Live-External AC (requires the DC lane GREEN). 71 coordinator tests pass; only these 2 rich-text render tests (a co-resident story-3388 suite) flake on index lag.","id":"2c60-c6d5-30bf-41bb","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live-DC rich-text search-index wait budget too marginal (90s) — flakes on Lucene lag"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787806744875546001,"uuid":"eb3ddc81-0672-4802-b5aa-f5852e7859e6"}